===============================================================================
PUDL Data Dictionary
===============================================================================

The PUDL data dictionary provides detailed metadata for the tables in the PUDL database.
This includes table descriptions, field names, field descriptions, and field datatypes.

.. note::
    You can find this data at the `PUDL Data
    Viewer <https://data.catalyst.coop>`__ if you want interactive search, filtering,
    and CSV export.

